OATHBLOOM — SUPPORT

Contact: support@appnovex.com
We usually reply within 2 business days. Please include your iPhone model and iOS version.


I BOUGHT SOMETHING BUT DIDN'T RECEIVE IT
Open Shop > Restore Purchases (also in Settings). The Starter Pack and Oath Pass are
restored automatically. If a gem pack is missing, email support@appnovex.com with the
Apple receipt from your purchase confirmation email.

HOW DO I GET A REFUND?
Refunds are handled by Apple at https://reportaproblem.apple.com

WHERE IS MY PROGRESS SAVED?
On your device only — there is no account. Deleting the app deletes your progress.
To start over, use Settings > Delete My Game Data.

REWARD VIDEOS
Videos are optional and limited per day. If none is available, try again later — ad
availability varies by region and time.

SUMMON ODDS
Tap View Odds on the Summon screen for every rate, the pity counter and the first 10x
guarantee.

